[32m+[m[32m            <h2 id="chapter-1-heading">Faith Was Never Meant<br><span class="title-italic">to Stay Quiet.</span></h2>[m
[32m+[m[32m            <p>[m
[32m+[m[32m              Most of us believe boldly on Sunday and go quiet by Tuesday. Not because our[m
[32m+[m[32m              faith shrank — because nobody asked. A shirt doesn't preach for you. But it[m
[32m+[m[32m              does something a sermon can't: it opens the door before you say a word.[m
