[32m+[m[32m            <p class="eyebrow">Faith Over Fear</p>[m
[32m+[m[32m            <h2 id="chapter-2-heading">The Hesitation Is Real.<br><span class="title-italic">So Is the Calling.</span></h2>[m
             <p>[m
[31m-              Christos.Fashion was created for believers who want to carry their faith beyond Sunday.[m
[31m-              Every design is intentional — crafted to encourage, inspire, and point people back to Jesus Christ.[m
[32m+[m[32m              There's a half-second before you put it on. <em>What if someone asks? What if I[m
[32m+[m[32m              don't have the right answer?</em> Every believer knows that pause. It isn't[m
[32m+[m[32m              weakness — it's the moment right before courage.[m
             </p>[m
             <p>[m
[31m-              We believe clothing can be more than fashion. When you wear a message that matters,[m
[31m-              it becomes a conversation. It becomes a witness. It becomes a statement of who you are and whose you are.[m
[32m+[m[32m              We design for that half-second. Wear it once and the fear gets smaller, because[m
[32m+[m[32m              you find out what most people actually do: they nod. They smile. Sometimes they[m
[32m+[m[32m              tell you what they're carrying, and you get to tell them Who carries you.[m
             </p>[m
[31m-            <a href="about.html" class="btn btn-outline" style="margin-top:8px">Read Our Story <span class="btn-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>[m
