[32m+[m[32m    <section class="section section-editorial surface-ivory" id="designs" aria-labelledby="designs-heading">[m
[32m+[m[32m      <div class="container">[m
[32m+[m[32m        <div class="section-header reveal" style="text-align:center">[m
[32m+[m[32m          <p class="eyebrow">Every Design Has a Reason</p>[m
[32m+[m[32m          <h2 id="designs-heading">The Message<br><span class="title-italic">Behind the Design.</span></h2>[m
[32m+[m[32m          <p class="section-lede">[m
[32m+[m[32m            We don't print words because they look good on cotton. Each one was chosen for a[m
[32m+[m[32m            specific moment a believer walks through. Here's what each design says — and who it's for.[m
[32m+[m[32m          </p>[m
[32m+[m[32m        </div>[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m        <div class="story-grid">[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m          <article class="story-card reveal">[m
[32m+[m[32m            <div class="story-card-art">[m
[32m+[m[32m              <img src="assets/designs/built-by-faith.png" alt="Built by Faith design artwork" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="600" height="600" />[m
[32m+[m[32m            </div>[m
[32m+[m[32m            <div>[m
[32m+[m[32m              <h3>Built by Faith</h3>[m
[32m+[m[32m              <p class="story-card-message">"Nothing in my life was built by me alone."</p>[m
[32m+[m[32m              <dl>[m
[32m+[m[32m                <dt>Why it matters</dt>[m
[32m+[m[32m                <dd>Achievement culture tells you to take the credit. This is a quiet correction — a reminder, worn on your chest, of who actually did the building.</dd>[m
[32m+[m[32m                <dt>Who it's for</dt>[m
[32m+[m[32m                <dd>The believer in a season of growth who wants to stay grounded while it happens.</dd>[m
[32m+[m[32m              </dl>[m
[32m+[m[32m              <div class="story-card-links">[m
[32m+[m[32m                <span class="eyebrow">Wear it with</span>[m
[32m+[m[32m                <a href="shop.html?filter=shirts">Work Hard, God First</a>[m
[32m+[m[32m                <a href="shop.html?filter=hats">Jesus Saves Hat</a>[m
[32m+[m[32m              </div>[m
[32m+[m[32m            </div>[m
[32m+[m[32m          </article>[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m          <article class="story-card reveal">[m
[32m+[m[32m            <div class="story-card-art">[m
[32m+[m[32m              <img src="assets/designs/faith-over-fear.png" alt="Faith Over Fear design artwork" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="600" height="600" />[m
[32m+[m[32m            </div>[m
[32m+[m[32m            <div>[m
[32m+[m[32m              <h3>Faith Over Fear</h3>[m
[32m+[m[32m              <p class="story-card-message">"Fear showed up first. Faith gets the final word."</p>[m
[32m+[m[32m              <dl>[m
[32m+[m[32m                <dt>Why it matters</dt>[m
[32m+[m[32m                <dd>Courage isn't the absence of fear — it's the decision made right after it. Three words that settle the argument before you have it.</dd>[m
[32m+[m[32m                <dt>Who it's for</dt>[m
[32m+[m[32m                <dd>Anyone standing at the edge of a hard decision: a diagnosis, a move, a conversation they've been avoiding.</dd>[m
[32m+[m[32m              </dl>[m
[32m+[m[32m              <div class="story-card-links">[m
[32m+[m[32m                <span class="eyebrow">Wear it with</span>[m
[32m+[m[32m                <a href="shop.html?filter=shirts">I Thought It Was Over</a>[m
[32m+[m[32m                <a href="shop.html?filter=shirts">God Taught Me</a>[m
[32m+[m[32m              </div>[m
[32m+[m[32m            </div>[m
[32m+[m[32m          </article>[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m          <article class="story-card reveal">[m
[32m+[m[32m            <div class="story-card-art">[m
[32m+[m[32m              <img src="assets/designs/i-thought-it-was-over.png" alt="I Thought It Was Over design artwork" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="600" height="600" />[m
[32m+[m[32m            </div>[m
[32m+[m[32m            <div>[m
[32m+[m[32m              <h3>I Thought It Was Over</h3>[m
[32m+[m[32m              <p class="story-card-message">"…but God wasn't finished."</p>[m
[32m+[m[32m              <dl>[m
[32m+[m[32m                <dt>Why it matters</dt>[m
[32m+[m[32m                <dd>The most powerful testimony in the room is usually the one nobody knows about. This starts that conversation without you having to.</dd>[m
[32m+[m[32m                <dt>Who it's for</dt>[m
[32m+[m[32m                <dd>The believer on the other side of something that nearly took them out — and anyone still in it who needs to see that other side exists.</dd>[m
[32m+[m[32m              </dl>[m
[32m+[m[32m              <div class="story-card-links">[m
[32m+[m[32m                <span class="eyebrow">Wear it with</span>[m
[32m+[m[32m                <a href="shop.html?filter=shirts">Faith Over Fear</a>[m
[32m+[m[32m                <a href="index.html#prayer">Send a prayer request</a>[m
[32m+[m[32m              </div>[m
[32m+[m[32m            </div>[m
[32m+[m[32m          </article>[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m          <article class="story-card reveal">[m
[32m+[m[32m            <div class="story-card-art">[m
[32m+[m[32m              <img src="assets/designs/jesus-saves-hat.png" alt="Jesus Saves trucker hat design artwork" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="600" height="600" />[m
[32m+[m[32m            </div>[m
[32m+[m[32m            <div>[m
[32m+[m[32m              <h3>Jesus Saves</h3>[m
[32m+[m[32m              <p class="story-card-message">The two boldest words in history, and no commentary needed.</p>[m
[32m+[m[32m              <dl>[m
[32m+[m[32m                <dt>Why it matters</dt>[m
[32m+[m[32m                <dd>No hedging, no clever wordplay. Worn on a cap it sits at eye level — the first thing someone reads when they look up at you.</dd>[m
[32m+[m[32m                <dt>Who it's for</dt>[m
[32m+[m[32m                <dd>The believer who's done being subtle about it. Also the easiest first piece if you're new to wearing your faith.</dd>[m
[32m+[m[32m              </dl>[m
[32m+[m[32m              <div class="story-card-links">[m
[32m+[m[32m                <span class="eyebrow">Wear it with</span>[m
[32m+[m[32m                <a href="shop.html?filter=shirts">Any tee in the collection</a>[m
[32m+[m[32m              </div>[m
[32m+[m[32m            </div>[m
[32m+[m[32m          </article>[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m          <article class="story-card reveal">[m
[32m+[m[32m            <div class="story-card-art">[m
[32m+[m[32m              <img src="assets/designs/pray-work-repeat.png" alt="Pray Work Repeat design artwork" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="600" height="600" />[m
[32m+[m[32m            </div>[m
[32m+[m[32m            <div>[m
[32m+[m[32m              <h3>Pray. Work. Repeat.</h3>[m
[32m+[m[32m              <p class="story-card-message">"Discipline is worship you can schedule."</p>[m
[32m+[m[32m              <dl>[m
[32m+[m[32m                <dt>Why it matters</dt>[m
[32m+[m[32m                <dd>Faith isn't only for the mountaintop. It's the rhythm of an ordinary Tuesday — pray, then go do the work, then do it again tomorrow.</dd>[m
[32m+[m[32m                <dt>Who it's for</dt>[m
[32m+[m[32m                <dd>Early risers, gym regulars, students, and anyone building something slowly and faithfully.</dd>[m
[32m+[m[32m              </dl>[m
[32m+[m[32m              <div class="story-card-links">[m
[32m+[m[32m                <span class="eyebrow">Wear it with</span>[m
[32m+[m[32m                <a href="shop.html?filter=shirts">Work Hard, God First</a>[m
[32m+[m[32m                <a href="shop.html?filter=shirts">Built by Faith</a>[m
[32m+[m[32m              </div>[m
