[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m          <article class="story-card reveal">[m
[32m+[m[32m            <div class="story-card-art">[m
[32m+[m[32m              <img src="assets/designs/christ-over-culture.png" alt="Christ Over Culture design artwork" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="600" height="600" />[m
[32m+[m[32m            </div>[m
[32m+[m[32m            <div>[m
[32m+[m[32m              <h3>Christ Over Culture</h3>[m
[32m+[m[32m              <p class="story-card-message">"Every generation is asked to choose. This is the answer."</p>[m
[32m+[m[32m              <dl>[m
[32m+[m[32m                <dt>Why it matters</dt>[m
[32m+[m[32m                <dd>Not a shot at anyone — a statement of allegiance. When the two point different directions, you already know which way you're going.</dd>[m
