[32m+[m[32m        <!-- FIT & CARE -->[m
[32m+[m[32m        <div class="care-panel reveal" style="margin-top:clamp(48px,6vw,72px)">[m
[32m+[m[32m          <div class="care-item">[m
[32m+[m[32m            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20.38 3.46L16 2a4 4 0 01-8 0L3.62 3.46a2 2 0 00-1.34 2.23l.58 3.47a1 1 0 00.99.84H6v10a2 2 0 002 2h8a2 2 0 002-2V10h2.15a1 1 0 00.99-.84l.58-3.47a2 2 0 00-1.34-2.23z"/></svg>[m
[32m+[m[32m            <h4>The Fit</h4>[m
[32m+[m[32m            <p>Classic unisex cut with a straight body — true to size for a relaxed fit, size down for something closer. Sizes XS–5XL across the tee range.</p>[m
[32m+[m[32m          </div>[m
[32m+[m[32m          <div class="care-item">[m
[32m+[m[32m            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2l3 6 6 .9-4.5 4.3 1.1 6.3L12 16.5 6.4 19.5l1.1-6.3L3 8.9 9 8z"/></svg>[m
[32m+[m[32m            <h4>The Fabric</h4>[m
[32m+[m[32m            <p>Soft, durable cotton chosen so the shirt keeps its shape and the print keeps its edges. Made to be worn weekly, not saved for special occasions.</p>[m
[32m+[m[32m          </div>[m
[32m+[m[32m          <div class="care-item">[m
[32m+[m[32m            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 6h18M8 6V4a2 2 0 012-2h4a2 2 0 012 2v2M6 6l1 14a2 2 0 002 2h6a2 2 0 002-2l1-14"/></svg>[m
[32m+[m[32m            <h4>The Care</h4>[m
[32m+[m[32m            <p>Machine wash cold, inside out, with like colours. Tumble dry low. Skip the iron on the print. That's the whole routine.</p>[m
[32m+[m[32m          </div>[m
[32m+[m[32m          <div class="care-item">[m
[32m+[m[32m            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="1" y="3" width="15" height="13"/><polygon points="16 8 20 8 23 11 23 16 16 16 16 8"/><circle cx="5.5" cy="18.5" r="2.5"/><circle cx="18.5" cy="18.5" r="2.5"/></svg>[m
[32m+[m[32m            <h4>The Delivery</h4>[m
[32m+[m[32m            <p>Printed on demand when you order, so nothing sits in a warehouse. Free shipping over $50, and easy returns if the fit isn't right.</p>[m
[32m+[m[32m          </div>[m
[32m+[m[32m        </div>[m
[32m+[m[32m      </div>[m
